.roster-hint .p1c{color:var(--p1);}
.roster-hint .p2c{color:var(--p2);}
.roster-hint em{font-style:normal;color:#ffd08a;font-weight:800;}

/* ============================== OVERLAY / MODAL ============================== */
.overlay{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:20;
  display:grid;place-items:center;
  background:radial-gradient(900px 600px at 50% 50%,rgba(5,9,16,.72),rgba(2,4,8,.9));
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  animation:fadeIn .22s ease both;
}
.modal{
  position:relative;
  width:720px;max-width:88%;
  padding:38px 42px 34px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(600px 300px at 50% 0%,rgba(255,150,50,.1),transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(22,31,48,.96),rgba(8,12,20,.98));
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  box-shadow:0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.7),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  text-align:center;
  animation:modalIn .34s cubic-bezier(.16,1.2,.3,1) both;
}
.modal-kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.4em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;}
.modal h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:48px;font-weight:700;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.01em;margin-bottom:8px;}
.modal h3 b{color:var(--gold);}
.modal-sub{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8fa3ba;line-height:1.7;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;}
.modal-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.btn-solid{
  min-width:170px;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:9px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffa742,#ff7a1a 55%,#e85400);
  color:#1c0c00;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;
  box-shadow:0 6px 0 #993200,0 12px 24px rgba(255,110,20,.3),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.5);
  transition:.14s;
}
.btn-solid:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);filter:brightness(1.06);}
.btn-solid:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:0 2px 0 #993200;}
.btn-line{
  min-width:150px;height:50px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:9px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:700;color:#cbd9ea;
  transition:.16s;
}
.btn-line:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#fff;}

.how-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;text-align:left;}
.how-item{
  display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;
  padding:12px 13px;border-radius:9px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
}
.how-item .k{
  flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;gap:3px;
}
.how-item .k b{
  min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:5px;
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#e7f0fb;
}
.how-item .k b.hot{background:rgba(255,122,26,.16);border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.4);color:#ffc38a;}
.how-item p{font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9fb0c6;letter-spacing:.02em;}
.how-item p b{color:#fff;font-weight:700;}
.how-item.full{grid-column:1/-1;}

.final-score{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:22px;margin:22px 0 6px;}
.fs-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-width:150px;}
.fs-num{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:64px;font-weight:700;line-height:.9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
.fs-name{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:700;color:#8fa3ba;}
.fs-p1 .fs-num{color:var(--p1);text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(55,217,255,.35);}
.fs-p2 .fs-num{color:var(--p2);text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,100,64,.35);}
.fs-mid{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:#5d6e84;letter-spacing:.1em;}
.winner-banner{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  margin-top:14px;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:99px;
  background:rgba(255,190,70,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,190,70,.3);
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);
}
.winner-banner svg{width:18px;height:18px;}
.qb-breakdown{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;}
.qb-cell{
  min-width:64px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:7px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
}
.qb-cell span{display:block;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#6f8198;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px;}
.qb-cell b{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;color:#e7eef8;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}

.pause-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:24px;}
.pause-list .btn-solid,.pause-list .btn-line{width:100%;}

/* countdown */
.countdown{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:22;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(600px 400px at 50% 50%,rgba(3,6,11,.45),transparent 75%);
}
.countdown .cd-num{
  font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:190px;line-height:.8;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#ffd27a 55%,#ff8a24);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35)) drop-shadow(0 0 60px rgba(255,140,40,.35));
  animation:countPop .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1.2,.3,1) both;
}
.countdown .cd-label{
  font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.5em;color:#b9c9dc;margin-top:16px;
  animation:fadeIn .5s .1s both;
}

/* new quarter banner */
.qbanner{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:21;display:grid;place-items:center;pointer-events:none;
}
.qbanner .qb-inner{
  text-align:center;
  animation:qbanner 2.2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both;
}
.qbanner .qb-top{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.5em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;}
.qbanner .qb-big{
  font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:92px;font-weight:700;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.02em;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#cfe4ff 55%,#7ea9d6);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35));
}

/* flash + vignette */
.flash{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:30;pointer-events:none;background:#fff;opacity:0;transition:opacity .18s;}
.flash.go{opacity:.55;transition:opacity .04s;}
.vignette{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:25;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 50%,transparent 52%,rgba(0,0,0,.34) 82%,rgba(0,0,0,.62) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.22),transparent 14%,transparent 84%,rgba(0,0,0,.3));
  mix-blend-mode:multiply;
}

/* boot */
.boot{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:50;
  display:grid;place-items:center;align-content:center;gap:14px;
  background:radial-gradient(700px 500px at 50% 45%,#0b1424,#03050a 70%);
  transition:opacity .6s ease,visibility .6s;
}
.boot.done{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;}
.boot-ball{width:64px;height:64px;color:var(--orange);animation:spin 1.5s linear infinite;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(255,122,26,.4));}
.boot-text{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.4em;color:#cfdcee;margin-left:.4em;}
.boot-bar{width:180px;height:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;}
.boot-bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:40%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--orange),transparent);animation:bootbar 1s ease-in-out infinite;}

/* ============================== animations ============================== */
@keyframes wordIn{from{opacity:0;transform:skewX(-6deg) translateY(34px) scale(.96);letter-spacing:16px;}to{opacity:1;transform:skewX(-6deg) translateY(0) scale(1);}}
@keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:skewX(-6deg) translateY(0);}50%{transform:skewX(-6deg) translateY(-6px);}}
@keyframes shine{0%,68%{left:-30%;}86%{left:120%;}100%{left:120%;}}
@keyframes marquee{from{transform:translateX(0);}to{transform:translateX(-50%);}}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
@keyframes bootbar{0%{transform:translateX(-110%);}100%{transform:translateX(280%);}}
@keyframes flicker{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1) rotate(-2deg);}50%{opacity:.7;transform:scale(.9) rotate(3deg);}}
@keyframes pulseSoft{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:.55;}}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
@keyframes modalIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px) scale(.97);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
@keyframes countPop{0%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.7);filter:blur(8px);}30%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);filter:blur(0);}75%{opacity:1;}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.94);}}
@keyframes qbanner{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px) scale(.96);}15%{opacity:1;transform:none;}80%{opacity:1;}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-16px);}}

@media (max-height:820px){
  .wordmark{font-size:170px;}
  .home-roster{height:96px;}
  .hr-card{height:96px;}
}

content.text:
Now utils.js with math/color/canvas helpers.

Include:
- clamp, lerp, invLerp, smoothstep, damp, rand, randInt, pick, TAU, deg, ease functions
- hex/rgb helpers: parseColor, mix, rgba, lighten, darken, shade
- canvas: makeCanvas, roundRect, ellipse, capsule, taperedLimb, polygon, radialGlow, drawText helpers
- seeded random for deterministic crowd.

Also `AB.U` global.

Need `hexToRgb`, `rgba(hex,a)`, `mix(hexA,hexB,t)`, `shade(hex,amt)`.
`withAlpha` handles hex.

Capsule drawing: 
```js
function capsule(ctx,x1,y1,x2,y2,r1,r2,fill){
  const dx=x2-x1,dy=y2-y1,d=Math.hypot(dx,dy)||0.0001;
  const a=Math.atan2(dy,dx);
  const p=Math.atan2(r2-r1, d); // hmm
  // use simple: two circles + quad connecting tangent points
  const nx=-dy/d, ny=dx/d;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.arc(x1,y1,r1, a+Math.PI/2, a-Math.PI/2, true)? 
```
Simpler: draw a thick line with round caps using lineWidth = r*2 (uniform radius). Tapered limbs aren't critical; but nice. Let me implement a proper tapered capsule using tangent lines:

Angle of the line a. The tangent from circle1 to circle2: offset angle `phi = Math.acos((r1-r2)/d)`? Actually for external tangents, the tangent line touches circle1 at angle a ± (π/2 - asin((r1-r2)/d))... Let's derive: the tangent line direction makes an angle with the center line of `alpha = Math.asin((r1-r2)/d)`. Hmm, easier with an approximation: draw the polygon from the perpendicular offsets with radii at each end and use quadratic curves. For a limb, uniform radius looks fine and is robust. Use `ctx.lineCap='round'` thick strokes. But for tapered forearms, I can draw a thick stroke then a smaller end cap? Not needed. I'll add a `limb()` helper that draws a tapered shape via bezier:
```
n = normalize perp
ctx.beginPath();
ctx.moveTo(x1+nx*r1, y1+ny*r1);
ctx.lineTo(x2+nx*r2, y2+ny*r2);
ctx.arc(x2,y2,r2, angle(n), angle(-n)) ... 
```
The arc from one tangent point to the other around the end. With approximate tangent points at the perpendicular, there's a slight discontinuity but with round-ish radii it's invisible. Let me use this approximate capsule; it works well.

Angles: n = (-dy/d, dx/d), angle of n = atan2(dx,dy)? Let me just construct:
```
const ang = Math.atan2(dy,dx);
const nx = -Math.sin(ang), ny = Math.cos(ang);
beginPath();
moveTo(x1+nx*r1, y1+ny*r1);
lineTo(x2+nx*r2, y2+ny*r2);
arc(x2,y2,r2, ang+Math.PI/2, ang-Math.PI/2, true); // going around the far end
lineTo(x1-nx*r1, y1-ny*r1);
arc(x1,y1,r1, ang-Math.PI/2, ang+Math.PI/2, true);
closePath();
```
Wait, arc direction: from point at angle ang+π/2 (which is (sin? )). Let's not overthink; use ctx.arc with anticlockwise. The tangent points are at ang ± π/2 from the center, offset by radius. Point on circle at angle `ang+π/2` = (cos(ang+π/2), sin(ang+π/2))*r = (-sin ang, cos ang)*r = n*r. Correct. The other is -n*r at angle ang-π/2. To go around the end circle from n*r (ang+π/2) to -n*r (ang-π/2) passing through the far direction (ang), we go clockwise in screen space? Angles decrease from ang+π/2 to ang-π/2 => anticlockwise=false (clockwise) passes through ang. In canvas, arc(cx,cy,r,start,end,anticlockwise). Default clockwise from start to end increasing angle. We want decreasing angle from ang+π/2 to ang-π/2, which is "anticlockwise=true". So `ctx.arc(x2,y2,r2, ang+Math.PI/2, ang-Math.PI/2, true)`. Good.

For the start circle, from -n*r (angle ang-π/2) to n*r (ang+π/2), passing around the near end (angle ang+π) → decreasing? From ang-π/2 to ang-π (=ang+π) ... Going anticlockwise from ang-π/2 to ang+π/2 via ang-π? Angles in canvas wrap; using `anticlockwise=true` from ang-π/2 to ang+π/2 goes through ang-π (the back). Yes. Good.

- roundRect: use ctx.roundRect if available else fallback path.
- `glow(ctx,x,y,r,color)`: radial gradient.
- `text(ctx, str, x,y, {font,size,color,align,weight,letterSpacing})` — letter-spacing not supported widely yet (ctx.letterSpacing is Chrome-only). Use ctx.letterSpacing where available? Chrome supports `ctx.letterSpacing = '2px'`. I'll implement a manual letterSpacing routine for headings to be safe: draw char by char. For perf, only for small labels. Let me add `spacedText` that uses ctx.letterSpacing if supported.

Seeded RNG: mulberry32.

easeOutCubic, easeInOutCubic, easeOutBack, easeOutElastic.

`formatClock(s)` → m:ss.

Also `AB.U.rgba(hex, alpha)` handles rgba input? Just hex.

Let me write it.

