Alpha 51 means the base isn't there at that point. Is the court drawn at y=730? Yes. Unless `Art.court` is null and what we see at 780 is something else? Bright pixel at 780 could be from a bench card? No, getImageData reads canvas only.

Maybe the arena backdrop is drawn with opaque, then court drawn. Should alpha 255 everywhere.

